  "display_title": "My Crazy Dramatic Fairy Tale",
  "description": "After the girl meets the prince, they live happily ever after, but don't you wonder what happens to the others? My name is Lynette Camellia, and after helping my sister meet her Romeo, I started a gossip column about the empire for fun. But instead of just writing about drama, I'm living it. Not only am I trying to escape an engagement to a man twice my age, but Prince Lucas wants to use me and my column to take down the evil crown prince! Who knew that a fairy tale could be so... dramatic?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
